X:1
T:Mistral Gagnant
C:Renaud, 1985
N:Best-effort version. A piano arrangement MIDI (hamienet.com) was the source;
N:its melody is mixed in with arpeggios, so the top line was pulled out and the
N:rhythm rounded to eighths. Notes and rhythm are approximate in the second
N:half. Moved down a fifth from B minor to E minor to fit the recorder.
N:Chords come from the same arrangement. One pass is 27 bars.
